sentences.text:
Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 12.03.2019 passed in MVC.No.955/2018 by 4th Addl.
District Judge & Sessions Judge, Hassan, District sitting at Channarayapatna is modified;

The enhanced compensation shall carry interest at the rate of 6% per annum;
v) The enhanced compensation amount shall be paid within a period of four weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment;
vi) The compensation amount shall be released in favour of the appellants-claimants upon proper verification;
vii) All other terms and conditions stipulated by the tribunal with regard to apportionment, release and fixed deposit shall stand intact;
Sd/-
JUDGE AMM * Correction carried out as per the Chamber Order dated 12.09.2024.
Mythri vs Divisional Controller, Ksrtc on 15 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/122004904/

